OL,3,GNEWSATwo deals discussed before
OL,4,ADrumcree parade ban, says Bryant
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Chris' decision followed a warning
OL,7,Ffrom the Police Service of Northern
OL,8,FIreland (PSNI) chief constable that
OL,9,Fallowing the procession to go ahead
OL,10,Fcould lead to serious injury, disorder
OL,11,Fand wider unrest across Northern
OL,12,FIreland.
